1
00:00:00,067 --> 00:00:01,467
Iron Man's arc reactor

2
00:00:01,467 --> 00:00:02,900
would cook him alive.

3
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:05,467
In the movie it makes

4
00:00:05,467 --> 00:00:07,367
three gigajoules every second.

5
00:00:07,367 --> 00:00:08,800
From his chest.

6
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,533
But no machine

7
00:00:10,533 --> 00:00:12,900
is a hundred percent efficient.

8
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,800
Even at ninety percent…

9
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,633
…that's three hundred million

10
00:00:16,633 --> 00:00:18,133
watts of waste heat.

11
00:00:18,133 --> 00:00:19,667
A small power plant,

12
00:00:19,667 --> 00:00:20,800
on his ribs.

13
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:23,633
Your body can get rid of

14
00:00:23,633 --> 00:00:25,300
about three hundred watts.

15
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,767
So I'm building

16
00:00:26,767 --> 00:00:28,333
a real flying suit.

17
00:00:28,333 --> 00:00:29,900
Rule one: physics wins.

18
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:32,233
Jet turbines instead of a reactor.

19
00:00:32,233 --> 00:00:33,800
Wings instead of hovering.

20
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,367
Every number is checked.

21
00:00:36,367 --> 00:00:39,800
Follow to see if it flies.

